{"seq":1,"slug":"neural-physics","title":"神经物理：用神经网络逼近物理仿真","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/world-models-simulation/neural-simulators/neural-physics","wordCount":1903,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"神经物理-用神经网络逼近物理仿真\">神经物理：用神经网络逼近物理仿真</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>神经物理（Neural Physics）是用神经网络直接学习物理动力学的研究方向。传统物理仿真器（MuJoCo、Bullet、PyBullet）基于显式微分方程求解，在精确性上有数学保证，但在三类场景下表现不佳：高维状态空间求解慢、复杂材料（柔性、流体、布料）建模困难、不支持端到端的反向传播。神经物理通过让神经网络从数据学习物理近似，提供了这些场景的替代方案。本节系统讲解神经物理的方法谱系、训练范式、以及与传统仿真的协同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[神经物理路线] --&gt; B[黑盒拟合]&#10;    A --&gt; C[物理引导网络]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Hamiltonian/Lagrangian]&#10;    A --&gt; E[符号回归]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[直接拟合 Δs]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[物理约束损失]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[保持能量守恒]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[发现物理方程]\">graph TD\n    A[神经物理路线] --&gt; B[黑盒拟合]\n    A --&gt; C[物理引导网络]\n    A --&gt; D[Hamiltonian/Lagrangian]\n    A --&gt; E[符号回归]\n    B --&gt; B1[直接拟合 Δs]\n    C --&gt; C1[物理约束损失]\n    D --&gt; D1[保持能量守恒]\n    E --&gt; E1[发现物理方程]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>物理保证</th>\n<th>训练数据需求</th>\n<th>推理速度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>黑盒 MLP</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>大量</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>简单系统、近似可接受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物理引导损失</td>\n<td>软（损失项）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>已知部分物理方程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hamiltonian NN</td>\n<td>硬（结构化）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>守恒系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>符号回归</td>\n<td>硬（学到方程）</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>简单系统、可解释性需求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"黑盒拟合-最简单的神经物理\">黑盒拟合：最简单的神经物理</h2><p>最直接的神经物理方法是用 MLP 或 Transformer 直接拟合状态转移：给定当前状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和动作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，预测下一状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这种方法不需要任何物理知识，纯数据驱动。</p>\n<p>工程实现：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>输入</strong>：当前状态向量（位置、速度、姿态等）+ 动作（力、力矩、扭矩）。</li>\n<li><strong>输出</strong>：下一状态向量。</li>\n<li><strong>损失</strong>：预测状态与真实状态的均方误差。</li>\n<li><strong>训练数据</strong>：在仿真或真实系统上采集大量 (s, a, s&#39;) 三元组。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>黑盒拟合的优势是简单、通用、推理快。在简单系统（如倒立摆、双足跳跃机器人）上能达到不错的精度。劣势是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>缺少物理一致性</strong>：网络可能学到违反物理的&quot;近似&quot;——例如能量不守恒、动量错误。</li>\n<li><strong>泛化能力差</strong>：在训练分布外的状态上预测可靠性大幅下降。</li>\n<li><strong>数据需求大</strong>：需要覆盖整个状态空间的大量数据，对复杂系统不现实。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"物理引导损失\">物理引导损失</h2><p>第二代神经物理方法通过在损失中加入物理约束来改善黑盒拟合：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[训练损失] --&gt; B[预测损失]&#10;    A --&gt; C[物理约束损失]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;||s_pred - s_true||²&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[能量守恒]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[动量守恒]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[已知方程残差]\">graph LR\n    A[训练损失] --&gt; B[预测损失]\n    A --&gt; C[物理约束损失]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"||s_pred - s_true||²\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[能量守恒]\n    C --&gt; C2[动量守恒]\n    C --&gt; C3[已知方程残差]</pre><p>常见的物理约束损失项：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>能量守恒</strong>：在没有外力做功的情况下，预测系统的总能量应该守恒。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>energy</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{energy}} = ||E_{t+1} - E_t||</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">energy</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣∣</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>动量守恒</strong>：在没有外力的情况下，系统总动量守恒。</li>\n<li><strong>已知方程残差</strong>：如果系统部分服从已知方程（例如刚体动力学的牛顿第二定律），把方程残差作为损失项。</li>\n<li><strong>物理量界限</strong>：物理量必须在合理范围（例如温度不能为负、概率为 [0, 1]）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>物理引导损失让模型在训练中学到的不只是&quot;匹配数据&quot;，更是&quot;符合物理原理&quot;。在数据稀缺时这种方法尤其有效——物理约束补偿了数据不足。</p>\n<p>PINN（Physics-Informed Neural Networks）是这一思路的系统化研究方向，已经被应用于流体力学、热传导、量子力学等多个物理领域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hamiltonian-与-lagrangian-网络\">Hamiltonian 与 Lagrangian 网络</h2><p>更深层的物理引导是直接把网络结构设计为符合特定物理框架。Hamiltonian Neural Networks（HNN）和 Lagrangian Neural Networks（LNN）是代表工作：</p>\n<p><strong>HNN</strong> 让网络学习 Hamiltonian 函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(q, p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（系统总能量），动力学通过 Hamilton 方程自动推导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>q</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{q} = \\frac{\\partial H}{\\partial p}, \\quad \\dot{p} = -\\frac{\\partial H}{\\partial q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这样网络结构本身保证能量守恒，不需要额外损失项。</p>\n<p><strong>LNN</strong> 类似地学习 Lagrangian 函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>q</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(q, \\dot{q})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，通过 Euler-Lagrange 方程推导动力学：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>q</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{d}{dt}\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial \\dot{q}} - \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial q} = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这一类方法的优势是物理保证强、可解释性高；劣势是仅适用于守恒系统（无摩擦、无能量耗散），实用范围有限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"符号回归\">符号回归</h2><p>符号回归（Symbolic Regression）尝试从数据中&quot;发现&quot;物理方程的符号形式，而非用神经网络近似。代表工作 AI Feynman、SR 等：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用遗传算法或神经搜索在符号空间（加减乘除、指数对数等基本算子）中寻找最简方程。</li>\n<li>训练目标是让方程预测匹配数据 + 方程本身简洁。</li>\n<li>找到的方程可以直接验证、积分、解析处理。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>符号回归在简单系统上能重新发现已知物理方程（如开普勒定律、引力公式），展示了惊人的能力。但在复杂系统（高维、非线性强）上仍然有显著局限——符号空间太大，搜索几乎不可能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与传统仿真器的协同\">与传统仿真器的协同</h2><p>神经物理在 2026 年并没有完全替代传统仿真器，而是形成互补：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>已知精确物理（刚体）</td>\n<td>传统仿真器（MuJoCo, Bullet）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂材料（柔性、流体）</td>\n<td>神经物理 / GNS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要极致速度（GPU 并行）</td>\n<td>神经物理（推理快）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要反向传播</td>\n<td>可微仿真（神经物理或可微传统仿真）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高精度科学计算</td>\n<td>传统仿真器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>工程实践中常常把两者混合使用——用传统仿真器处理刚体动力学，用神经网络补全难建模部分（接触模型、摩擦细节）。这种&quot;残差神经物理&quot;是当前最实用的范式之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关键挑战\">关键挑战</h2><p>神经物理的核心挑战：</p>\n<p><strong>误差累积</strong>：神经网络的每步预测都有小误差，多步 rollout 后误差累积让长期预测失效。规避方法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>短期 rollout（限制 horizon）。</li>\n<li>周期性纠正（用真实数据校准）。</li>\n<li>不确定性量化（高不确定时不信任预测）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>分布外泛化</strong>：神经物理在训练分布内表现良好，分布外大幅退化。这与黑盒模型的本质局限相关。物理引导损失能部分缓解但不解决根本。</p>\n<p><strong>评测难度</strong>：如何衡量&quot;神经物理学到了真物理&quot;？预测精度只能反映训练分布内的拟合，不反映物理一致性。需要专门设计的评测（守恒律检查、对称性检查、长期稳定性）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程实践建议\">工程实践建议</h2><p>应用神经物理的工程经验：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>从简单基线开始</strong>：黑盒 MLP + MSE 损失先跑通基础流程。</li>\n<li><strong>如果已知部分物理，加引导损失</strong>：物理引导损失几乎总能提升。</li>\n<li><strong>务必做长期 rollout 测试</strong>：单步预测精度不能反映整体可用性。</li>\n<li><strong>混合使用传统仿真</strong>：把传统仿真处理&quot;已知物理&quot;，神经网络处理&quot;残差&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>对接评测体系</strong>：设计能反映物理一致性的评测，而非只看预测精度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>神经物理是用神经网络逼近物理仿真的研究方向，从黑盒拟合到 Hamiltonian/Lagrangian 网络再到符号回归，方法谱系逐步深入物理结构。当前的工程实践是混合使用——传统仿真处理已知物理，神经网络补全难建模部分。理解神经物理的方法谱系与局限，能让研究者根据问题特性选择合适的工具组合，避免简单地用&quot;神经网络替代一切&quot;或&quot;坚持传统仿真&quot;。神经物理在柔性物体、流体、高维系统等场景的优势已被验证，与传统仿真的协同将是未来仿真研究的主线方向。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"神经物理：用神经网络逼近物理仿真","id":"神经物理-用神经网络逼近物理仿真"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"黑盒拟合：最简单的神经物理","id":"黑盒拟合-最简单的神经物理"},{"level":2,"text":"物理引导损失","id":"物理引导损失"},{"level":2,"text":"Hamiltonian 与 Lagrangian 网络","id":"hamiltonian-与-lagrangian-网络"},{"level":2,"text":"符号回归","id":"符号回归"},{"level":2,"text":"与传统仿真器的协同","id":"与传统仿真器的协同"},{"level":2,"text":"关键挑战","id":"关键挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"工程实践建议","id":"工程实践建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"JEPA 架构：非生成式世界模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/world-models-simulation/classical-world-models/jepa-architecture"},"next":{"title":"Graph Network Simulators (GNS) 图网络模拟器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/world-models-simulation/neural-simulators/graph-network-simulators"}}